                <l xml:id="m-ac0a5c1a-e0b3-4b59-99e3-8f8f8fd130e4" facs="#m-ef783239-bedc-47bb-8818-a062dfc97d88" label="ambiguous">783</l><l xml:id="m-ba863378-ced7-4e29-85ac-77c2aff6f0b6" facs="#m-6bd66570-9333-44ca-a04e-ca21bee8d8fd" label="text-like">At Vespers</l><l xml:id="m-a59ba214-9bb2-4c48-b3cb-8ea3cdff57af" facs="#m-05e16dc8-1aa7-4658-947e-b5ad1de05f51" label="ambiguous">5. Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-868784fd-16c8-42fe-902d-0797618cd3bb" facs="#m-9c256ecc-7ffb-4ee3-895b-717f09b087d4" label="ambiguous">8.6</l><l xml:id="m-9bfacf35-d6b3-4f3c-8301-cb1b45cee939" facs="#m-57e65d35-ec79-4278-84d0-2222117d5e10" label="ambiguous">R</l><l xml:id="m-3d128872-1ef4-411a-933c-c52553719d0b" facs="#m-182c147a-96ab-4ae8-8f30-476720f43236" label="lyrics-like">Espón¬</l><l xml:id="m-01848045-a5c2-4133-b647-9310dd803cd3" facs="#m-92d34602-7c38-45af-9166-236ac485cbd5" label="lyrics-like">ve-lut mórtu-i, alle-lú-ia. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-12f7ae44-ce41-499f-9d72-22122a631bb1" facs="#m-72225f97-5869-4375-82cf-355ea53f3170" label="lyrics-like">dens autem Ange-lus" díxit mu-li¬ bus: No-li-te ti¬</l><l xml:id="m-34ddd83c-aa93-45a9-816e-e0a165f874b9" facs="#m-b365f5f8-9e7b-4f21-916d-e76101901ce9" label="lyrics-like">mé-re: sci-o enim quod Jésum quaéri-tis, alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-b2159914-2e52-4b8a-95f0-b82d410d5d2d" facs="#m-0d6a0d64-eacf-423c-9d2b-638685226ea7" label="ambiguous">Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-8e12f13a-460a-45ac-8641-d2bc2c7e6cf6" facs="#m-a3d6225a-e284-4991-8e23-20c3c27a98e7" label="text-like">Chapter, Hymn, and Versicle are all omitted, but the following Antiphon</l><l xml:id="m-118b11cd-9ebf-4bc9-882e-17668c5afb33" facs="#m-b2a6a111-35bc-4741-9faf-8fdd9f16857f" label="text-like">is said:</l><l xml:id="m-91acdf3c-275f-4125-b430-921efc434998" facs="#m-30db2dd3-8f40-48d3-b635-012c63624407" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-315ab180-f092-49f8-a5be-b8c9b239b5f7" facs="#m-71cf60b9-3378-4930-afed-8594666364d9" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-90c9eb41-4744-4edb-8836-8c05eea76573" facs="#m-944ad34a-4845-4a6c-b21d-ded0f7c7e597" label="ambiguous">R </l><l xml:id="m-6c6ddb12-d91e-4c9b-8944-a09b747b3fd0" facs="#m-75bf7d34-6b3b-4a46-b019-d62e4546b2db" label="lyrics-like">Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-e7ada87f-9567-42ad-aaba-672394614dc5" facs="#m-a54946f6-8fac-4b9a-9f46-38ed254a13f3" label="lyrics-like">dí¬</l><l xml:id="m-ff0b6f35-9606-4232-942e-b3f37a5a87f6" facs="#m-566a98f9-46a3-42de-b71d-35567594c117" label="lyrics-like">quam fé-cit</l><l xml:id="m-3977ff1e-2417-45de-b485-c0fc46f13cc3" facs="#m-3a1a151b-2bac-42c1-8af9-2ae1a33cbbdd" label="ambiguous">es,</l><l xml:id="m-d0c3e7aa-9373-4c67-b33f-fba8efb590bd" facs="#m-2fa32d73-3fcf-4935-84c7-991c32867b98" label="lyrics-like">exsulté¬</l><l xml:id="m-b16daef4-85be-4c72-a406-a2be2c251a4b" facs="#m-ecf955ab-38a3-41c1-84a8-55e420a9459f" label="ambiguous">mi- nus:</l><l xml:id="m-3b5b9620-51ac-43f1-ae45-67e8de49123f" facs="#m-ab6ece91-ba20-465b-a00a-44d9235fac51" label="ambiguous">mus,</l><l xml:id="m-91b91af1-9129-4696-8d98-174b3924a2d1" facs="#m-9f768f92-5e9a-4695-a6b6-1d3c211c3114" label="lyrics-like">et lae-té¬ mur in é¬ a.</l><l xml:id="m-5d088496-0d4f-4c30-a6c4-db91008ba00b" facs="#m-f0d7443a-1bc5-4a56-8bee-b6c8a275481d" label="text-like">At Magnif.</l><l xml:id="m-81d2f7cc-cab8-48f1-9846-13651b067ad2" facs="#m-672301b2-a706-4c28-a26f-9dac7069e170" label="ambiguous">Ant. s. a</l><l xml:id="m-8cdff2c1-2a6b-4eaa-8265-b71a9d2f73fd" facs="#m-0a48dbbf-7128-4d6e-b7ae-89e74a676f52" label="lyrics-like">"vidérunt revo-lú-tum lápi¬</l><l xml:id="m-fec57a07-9800-44b2-b55d-698f2e2ac50d" facs="#m-61f06d66-eb90-4661-ab9a-a0caca1e861d" label="lyrics-like">T respi-ci-én-tes</l><l xml:id="m-958d38ca-f775-4e0b-9d63-351f4ee5a015" facs="#m-ec3610f1-b36b-40e7-83cd-56992d55dffc" label="lyrics-like">dem: érat quippe mágnus valde, alle-lú-ia. Eu ou a e.</l><l xml:id="m-3fe0580c-d9c0-477f-ad34-afc28138e47d" facs="#m-8725e76f-3a1a-4992-a792-7f36d0954dc0" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. 3. a. p. 208, or p. 214.</l><l xml:id="m-62ae1fb7-54c2-4078-a4cd-3f6fe258d583" facs="#m-ffa69fa7-4b09-46ef-a611-b4a36b9a0ff1" label="lyrics-like">Prayer. Deus qui hodiérna die. p. 778.</l><l xml:id="m-5e99c5bc-460f-4ba0-8a12-9d4d8b0cb5d9" facs="#m-31e009bb-794b-490d-ba09-ef9de7c9c54e" label="lyrics-like">V. Benedi-cámus Dómino,</l><l xml:id="m-1ff367ba-5dcf-4175-bd89-554b480d0a42" facs="#m-ca9cf501-a63a-42ac-acb7-edb1b1dab461" label="lyrics-like">alle-lú-ia, alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-c13ca30d-9488-4568-96cd-cde2523fa176" facs="#m-6a2c64ae-93c4-428e-a2b7-cf631b91f4be" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-56ac5722-8a62-4238-b6f6-93831d5cbe56" facs="#m-505e715b-348e-4f1e-b258-eb14d26e630f" label="lyrics-like">N. Dé¬ grá-ti-as.</l><l xml:id="m-86dd8f8c-6bcf-45e5-812e-a9260af03cf3" facs="#m-8637c101-cb34-407c-ae29-b3736685e824" label="lyrics-like">alle-lú-ia,</l><l xml:id="m-bc27b131-944c-4c68-afe0-374149292db2" facs="#m-a359e0ab-4bc8-4ebd-b465-15b0630a3429" label="lyrics-like">alle- lú-ia</l></lg>
